# Input for the hash-pinned zizmor.txt used by .github/workflows/zizmor.yml.
# Renovate (pip-compile manager) re-runs the command recorded in zizmor.txt's
# header, and only understands the --flag=value spelling. Regenerate with:
#   uv pip compile --universal --generate-hashes --python-version=3.13 \
#     .github/requirements/zizmor.in --output-file=.github/requirements/zizmor.txt
zizmor
